1
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,900
Ben Siever, get your hollowhead in here.

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:10,940
Mr. Siever, do you think that I'm a fool?

3
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:13,720
Sir, I was just repeating what everyone else was saying.

4
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:17,040
Don't smart -mouth me.

5
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:21,260
You have requested an application for the advanced placement exam.

6
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:22,760
