Did I honk the horn?

110
00:06:14,140 --> 00:06:15,520
Nah, he wouldn't.

111
00:06:16,300 --> 00:06:22,300
He might. This is where I hid.

112
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:24,060
How stupid can you be?

113
