This street, three houses down.

126
00:07:08,060 --> 00:07:10,920
Oh. Oh, um, a little advice.

127
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:13,880
If you ever order a pizza, just give him your address.

128
00:07:15,860 --> 00:07:16,660
Here it is.

129
00:07:16,900 --> 00:07:18,200
Let me take a wild shot here.

130
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:19,220
You're a friend of Carol's, right?

131
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:25,160
Carol. Carol? Ooh, I could say that name for hours.

132
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:27,100
Well, please don't.

133
