I just ate.

134
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:30,520
Okay. Hey, Conan, the librarian!

135
00:07:59,060 --> 00:08:00,500
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

136
00:08:00,500 --> 00:08:03,220
to Long Island so that we could be together.

137
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:05,320
You said, see you around.

138
00:08:07,460 --> 00:08:09,120
Right, and then the next day I moved here.

139
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:14,760
You moved here a month ago to be near me and this is the first time you've come

140
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:17,560
over? I didn't want to appear too forward.

141
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:23,820
Wow. I mean, nobody has ever changed their zip code for me.

142
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:26,480
I mean, hardly anyone's held a door for me.

143
00:08:27,420 --> 00:08:28,900
I don't know what to say.

144
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:31,360
I knew it.

145
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,240
I'm rushing you.

146
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,160
Pushy, pushy, pushy.

147
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:37,920
I'll come back next month.

148
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:41,500
No, wait. I think it's sweet.

149
00:08:42,680 --> 00:08:44,340
I'm glad you tracked me down.

150
00:08:45,500 --> 00:08:52,240
Groovy. Would you like to come over to my house and listen to some Gregorian chants?

151
00:08:53,340 --> 00:08:54,480
You have them on CD?

152
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,260
No, I sing them.

153
00:08:58,340 --> 00:08:59,680
I'm sorry. Groovy.

154
