160
00:09:17,060 --> 00:09:19,620
Three boys share a three -quart canteen of water.

161
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:23,900
If the first boy drinks twice as much as the other two, what do they each get?

162
00:09:24,400 --> 00:09:25,820
A mouthful of backwash.

163
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:28,160
What's with you?

164
