Yesterday you were all pumped about taking a test.

165
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:32,600
Yeah? Well, that was before I played hide and seek.

166
00:09:33,660 --> 00:09:36,580
Okay, first I'm gonna move all of Carol's stuffed animals to the attic.

167
00:09:36,620 --> 00:09:39,460
Uh -huh. I'm gonna get rid of all those dead flowers, and then I'm gonna get one of

168
00:09:39,460 --> 00:09:41,240
those pictures of those dogs playing poker.

169
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:42,720
Ooh, ooh, ooh!

170
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,460
Get two. I need a birthday present for Kate.

171
