I don't want to end up at Alpheland in junior college.

174
00:09:52,460 --> 00:09:55,840
You know, their entrance exam is guessing the number of beans in a jar.

175
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:58,180
Uh, Mike went to Al Flanders.

176
