And for your information, that bean thing isn't half as easy as it sounds.

177
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,680
Hey, guys. Hey, Dad.

178
00:10:06,900 --> 00:10:09,100
I could use some assistance with the firewood.

179
00:10:09,380 --> 00:10:10,700
Uh, sorry, no can do.

180
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,640
Luke and I gotta go fumigate Carol's room.

181
00:10:14,160 --> 00:10:17,580
Well, Ben, could you pick out four or five good dry logs, please?

182
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:19,280
Kenny, you wanna come in for some hot chocolate?

183
00:10:19,300 --> 00:10:20,180
Oh, no, thank you, Dr.

184
00:10:20,260 --> 00:10:21,400
Siever. I've gotta go home and study.

185
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:25,600
Study, ah. To my boys, study is just a room where Mrs.

186
