Well, you want to get together and review this tomorrow?

188
00:10:33,040 --> 00:10:44,920
We'll see. I can't believe we just spent the last six hours together.

189
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:47,920
I know. It only seemed like two hours and 38 minutes.

190
00:10:48,980 --> 00:10:51,420
It's amazing how much we have in common.

191
00:10:51,860 --> 00:10:55,540
I can't believe somebody else actually knows all the president's birthstones.

192
00:10:56,540 --> 00:10:58,080
I have to be honest with you.

193
00:10:58,180 --> 00:11:01,360
Millard Fillmore turquoise was just a lucky guess.

194
00:11:03,860 --> 00:11:09,220
Carol, I've never felt such an intense connection with anyone else before.

195
00:11:10,140 --> 00:11:11,200
I'm on fire.

196
00:11:14,060 --> 00:11:18,060
Me too. I can feel the electricity flowing through my body.

197
00:11:18,620 --> 00:11:20,020
I can't wait another minute.

198
00:11:25,400 --> 00:11:30,500
Woohoo. Me too.

199
